{"id":"fortuna","lemma":"fortuna","pos":"noun","rank":1420,"glosses":["fortune","fortune, prophecy, reading","wealth"],"ipa":"/foɾˈtuna/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fortunas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fortuna.wav","examples":[{"text":"La fortuna le sonrió.","en":"Fortune smiled on him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734307"},{"text":"Por fortuna no murió nadie.","en":"Luckily nobody died.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449689"},{"text":"Mi tío hizo una fortuna.","en":"My uncle made a fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39630"},{"text":"Él acumuló una gran fortuna.","en":"He accumulated a large fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589823"},{"text":"Tiene que haber costado una fortuna.","en":"It must've cost a fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422681"}]}